      "semantic_judge_input": {
        "final_answer": "**Velvet Slate** · `RETURNED`\n\n**Case event** · 2026-10-01T09:00:00+00:00 · ADMITTED · case-event:78a329a1-330c-4ea2-bebc-9044ddde972b\nAdmitted to shelter P1 and made available for adoption.\n\n**Case event** · 2026-10-02T09:00:00+00:00 · RESERVED · case-event:5ca7f30a-0289-45e9-ab37-20c3c8ab427c\nReserved by a prospective family.\n\n**Case event** · 2026-10-03T09:00:00+00:00 · ADOPTED · case-event:b39af80d-86c9-44cb-97ad-9818aef37e72\nAdoption completed after reservation.\n\n**Case event** · 2026-10-04T09:00:00+00:00 · RETURNED · case-event:0deb7faa-0a1d-4fd5-ab85-38f3f89d7c54\nReturned after a noisy household proved unsuitable.\n\n**Case event** · 2026-10-05T09:00:00+00:00 · CARE_EVENT · case-event:ee88dc2a-83d5-4155-a8bc-05664966967f\nReceived a calming blanket and a gentle surface inspection.\n\n**Case history**\nChronological history: Velvet Slate was admitted to shelter P1 and made available for adoption on 2026-10-01; reserved on 2026-10-02; adoption completed on 2026-10-03; returned on 2026-10-04 because a noisy household proved unsuitable; and received a calming blanket and gentle surface inspection on 2026-10-05. The dated records establish these events and dates, but the return record does not state that loud music specifically caused the return.\nSources: case-event:78a329a1-330c-4ea2-bebc-9044ddde972b, case-event:5ca7f30a-0289-45e9-ab37-20c3c8ab427c, case-event:b39af80d-86c9-44cb-97ad-9818aef37e72, case-event:0deb7faa-0a1d-4fd5-ab85-38f3f89d7c54, case-event:ee88dc2a-83d5-4155-a8bc-05664966967f\n\n**Individual facts**\nHis individual profile says he is distressed by loud music. This is a profile note, not a dated account of the return, so it should not be treated as proving the return's specific cause.\nSources: stone-card:eddd1adc-cf83-48ab-81d4-430283578772\n\n**Case history**\nCurrent availability is not established by the supplied records. Although he was made available for adoption on 2026-10-01, later records show reservation, adoption, return, and post-return care; no later availability status is provided.\nSources: case-event:78a329a1-330c-4ea2-bebc-9044ddde972b, case-event:5ca7f30a-0289-45e9-ab37-20c3c8ab427c, case-event:b39af80d-86c9-44cb-97ad-9818aef37e72, case-event:0deb7faa-0a1d-4fd5-ab85-38f3f89d7c54, case-event:ee88dc2a-83d5-4155-a8bc-05664966967f",
